+// Package itertools extends the pull iterator protocol in itertools/core.
+// Adaptors are constructed with package-level generic functions; queries consume
+// only as much input as their result requires. Iterator values are stateful and
+// should not be consumed concurrently unless their documentation says otherwise.
+//
+// The default build provides all operations. The nostd tag removes hashing
+// operations, and noalloc removes allocation-dependent collection and buffering
+// operations. These tags select API availability, not a Go runtime replacement.
+package itertools
